INSID3 Research extensions

This repository contains, unmodified, the official INSID3 implementation
(https://github.com/visinf/INSID3, commit 0c165a10cf52ab91f335883d06260de86854adbe),
Copyright the INSID3 authors, licensed under the Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE).
The only change to the upstream tree is that README.md was moved to upstream/UPSTREAM_README.md.
upstream/UPSTREAM_MANIFEST.sha256 lists the checksums of all upstream files.

Added files (insid3_ext/, scripts/, configs/, tests/, results/, docs/ except docs/data.md, *.sh, NOTICE,
README.md, requirements-research.txt, requirements-tested-cpu.txt, environment.yml,
env.example.sh) implement research extensions on top of the official code and are provided under the
same Apache License 2.0.
